6,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I'm worried about who can actually reach us! I'll check the bus links in the two outer wards and attendance sheets from former outreach stops.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,"I'll look into the county grant terms and the endowment, plus running and equipment lines last year. We must ensure the funding is sustainable.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,We always ignore the past. I'm choosing the two programmes begun six years ago and evening room bookings and remote catalogue use.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
