30,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"Suppliers are unreliable for some tech, and winter roads are a real problem. We can't rely on things we can't control.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,Yumi,,"It's worse than we thought. Outer wards lost bus links, but old outreach data shows huge demand there. We have to go to them.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,George,,"The grants are temporary. They cover a year, then hit the operating budget. Also, vehicle costs overran significantly last year.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,May,,"History repeats. A digitisation project failed years ago, but partner-run evening groups are still going strong without our help.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"We have retired tradespeople volunteering, but no staff are trained to supervise outside facilitators. Also, our tool certification expert is gone.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@George, if vehicle costs are overrunning, a mobile service is a financial and logistical risk, especially with the road closures I found.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Ryuji, but the people in those wards are stranded! We can't just ignore them because of a few snow days.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,George,,"@Yumi, I agree with the need, but the funding structure is a trap. We need something that doesn't create a budget cliff.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,May,,"@George, that's why we should look at the partner-run model. It's sustainable because the community carries it.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@May, but who supervises them? My research shows we lack the internal training to manage outside facilitators safely.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Daisuke, that makes a Maker Workshop dangerous if the certification is gone. We need a low-dependency model.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Daisuke, would Language Circles need the same technical supervision as power tools? Maybe that's a safer way to reach people.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,George,,"@Yumi, as long as the grant doesn't leave us stranded in year two. We need to use the endowment for capital.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,May,,"@George, the evening groups proved that community-led models work. We should avoid the ""big project"" failure of the archives.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I just don't want the staff to burn out. If it's too complex to manage, it will fail.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,"It seems we must balance accessibility with reliability. A fixed building is safe, but a mobile one is risky.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,4,talk,Yumi,,But a fixed building is useless to someone with no bus.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,4,talk,George,,We need a solution that fits the endowment and doesn't bleed the operating budget.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,4,talk,May,,Let's look at the candidates with these constraints in mind.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,I agree. Let's see what the options are.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
